    "m2": {
      "say": "Every flare wake bends the same direction — out past the belt. Heavy freighter convoys running dark, all vectored at Jupiter. Somebody out there is drinking sunlight by the tanker-load.",
      "to": "m4"
    },
    "m3": {
      "say": "PASSING THROUGH? This is the tallest peak humans have ever stood on. Show some respect. ...Though between us, it's the sky that worries me now, not the summit.",
      "to": "m2"
    },
    "m1": {
      "say": "Halt! State your business at Olympic Mons Garrison. ...Oh. You're the flare investigator the Capitol wired about. At ease, everyone.",
